From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:41:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(books): forward Java book edits to Bedrock

Translate page replacement, insertion, deletion, and signing into Bedrock BookEdit operations. Keep the local book pages current so consecutive Java saves do not insert duplicate pages before the server inventory update arrives.
---
 .../protocol/packet/InventoryPackets.java     | 85 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 85 insertions(+)

